msgid "User provided field elevation in meters\\. This is used to improve the calculation of the altitude the vehicle is at\\. This parameter is not persistent and will be reset to 0 every time the vehicle is rebooted\\. Changes to this parameter will only be used when disarmed\\. A value of 0 means the EKF origin height is used for takeoff height above sea level\\."
