#: 3641fc9f1b6a46448035cad0412f0dcd
#: 5543595bb65e42f38046ede31471f58f
msgid "This is the ratio of static pressure error to dynamic pressure generated by a positive wind relative velocity along the Y body axis\\. If the baro height estimate rises during sideways flight to the right\\, then this should be a negative number\\. Multirotors can use this feature only if using EKF3 and if the EK3\\_DRAG\\_BCOEF\\_X and EK3\\_DRAG\\_BCOEF\\_Y parameters have been tuned\\."
msgstr ""

