#: 318beb4e8737486684a31bedb8347f06
#: 9f9f109177174c3aa194f9271758db5f
msgid "This is the ratio of static pressure error to dynamic pressure generated by a positive wind relative velocity along the Z body axis\\. If the baro height estimate rises above truth height during climbing flight \\(or forward flight with a high forwards lean angle\\)\\, then this should be a negative number\\. Multirotors can use this feature only if using EKF3 and if the EK3\\_DRAG\\_BCOEF\\_X and EK3\\_DRAG\\_BCOEF\\_Y parameters have been tuned\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:4074
