#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:34654
#: 436c4a31666b41f0b4a1ccc46f57f526
msgid "lanes have to be consistently better than the primary by at least this threshold to reduce their overall relativeCoreError\\, lowering this makes lane switching more sensitive to smaller error differences"
